---

<BaseLayout
  title="2026科学上网与机场推荐指南：优质梯子节点横向评测与Mihomo配置大盘"
  description="2026年最新科学上网梯子与节点选型门户。汇总神行加速、大佬云、榴莲云等9家主流服务商的官方资费、优缺点对比与站点实时核验，提供Mihomo客户端分流与报错排查。"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 space-y-12">
    <!-- Hero Branding Header -->
    <section class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-8 pt-2">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-600 font-mono">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
          <span>2026 整理自官方公开资料 · 站点实时核验</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">
          机场网
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base font-medium text-slate-600 sm:text-lg">
          您身边的机场评测专家
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          基于各服务商官方公开技术资料整理与站点实时核验，坚决杜绝夸大吹嘘与虚构跑分。深度梳理 IPLC 专线、BGP 动态中继与新一代加密协议，为您提供实事求是、中立客观的科学出海节点选型与客户端配置指南。
        </p>

        <!-- Prominent Search Bar in Hero -->
        <div class="pt-1 max-w-xl">
          <div class="relative flex items-center group">
            <svg class="absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-4 w-4 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-slate-600 transition-colors pointer-events-none" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z" />
            </svg>
            <input
              type="text"
              placeholder="站内即时检索：输入机场名称（神行加速/大佬云）、客户端（小火箭/Clash）或协议..."
              onclick="const el = document.getElementById('site-search-input'); if(el) { el.focus(); el.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'}); }"
              class="w-full h-10 pl-10 pr-20 text-xs rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white shadow-sm placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:outline-none hover:border-slate-400 cursor-pointer transition-colors"
              readonly
            />
            <span class="absolute right-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-400 bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-slate-200">
              Ctrl K
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Hero Matrix Section -->
    <section>
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-4 gap-2">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl">
            2026 主流服务商全景横向速查大盘
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
            横向对比线路类型、公开资费、测速状态说明、流媒体支持与官方通道入口。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-400">
          核验周期：{currentYearMonth}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Objective Disclosure Alert -->
      <div class="mb-5 border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 rounded-xl p-4 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-slate-900 text-white font-mono text-[10px] rounded font-bold">声明</span>
          <strong class="text-slate-900">数据源真实性与测速状态公开说明：</strong>
        </div>
        <p>
          本站坚决杜绝为了促成商业转化而编造虚假跑分图表。目前全站所收录的各家服务商信息，<strong>本站暂未开展全量独立的晚高峰网络测速采样</strong>；文中所列出的线路架构、资费档位与协议参数，<strong>均整理自各服务商官方最新公开技术白皮书与运营公告</strong>。
        </p>
        <p>
          本站评测团队已对收录服务商的<strong>官方主站可访问性、当前套餐标价、专属优惠码真实抵扣及后台系统进行了实时核验</strong>。网络质量受各地宽带运营商及国际网络波动影响，请以官方实际交付为准，坚持优先月付订阅。
        </p>
      </div>

      <DecisionMatrix />
    </section>

    <!-- Featured Service Cards Grid -->
    <section>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl">
            精选服务商深度规格拆解
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
            包含基础参数、套餐资费、测速状态说明与客观优缺点清单。
          </p>
        </div>
        <a href="/category/pingce" class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 underline underline-offset-4">
          查看全部 8 家单篇深度报告 →
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        {featuredAirports.map((airport) => (
          <AirportCard {...airport} />
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Recent Blog Posts & Client Guides -->
    <section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200">
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200 pb-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">最新实测手记与配置文章</h2>
          <a href="/category/jiaocheng" class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900">
            全部教程 →
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
          {sortedPosts.slice(0, 5).map((post) => (
            <article class="py-3 flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
              <div>
                <a
                  href={`/articles/${post.slug.replace(/^articles\//, '')}`}
                  class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-900 hover:underline"
                >
                  {post.data.title}
                </a>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 line-clamp-1">
                  {post.data.description}
                </p>
              </div>
              <time class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono shrink-0">
                {post.data.pubDate.toISOString().split('T')[0]}
              </time>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Knowledge & Principles Sidebar -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">避坑核心准则</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4 bg-slate-50 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          <div>
            <strong class="text-slate-900 block mb-1">1. 坚守月付订阅原则</strong>
            <p>跨境服务天然具备不确定性。无论宣传背景如何，坚决拒绝一次性大额年付与终身包。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-2">
            <strong class="text-slate-900 block mb-1">2. 杜绝虚构测速图表</strong>
            <p>本站暂无开展全量独立测速采样，仅整理官方公开数据与实时核验。以用户本地自测为准。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-2">
            <strong class="text-slate-900 block mb-1">3. 双订阅冷热冗余配置</strong>
            <p>日常配置主力专线搭配不限时备用按量包，主链路发生网络抖动时毫秒级切换，杜绝失联。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-1">
            <a href="/risk" class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 underline">阅读完整 5 大风控哲学 →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Error Troubleshooting Table -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-2">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl">
          高频网络报错与排障检索表
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
          针对节点超时、TLS 握手失败、TUN 网卡无网络等典型长尾故障的快速处置 SOP。
        </p>
      </div>
      <ErrorTable />
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ Accordion Section -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-2">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl">
          科学上网常见疑问与选型指南 (FAQ)
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
          汇总初学者与进阶极客关于专线选型、协议配置与资产安全的高频解答。
        </p>
      </div>
      <FaqAccordion items={faqs} />
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
